WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.576
Priya: Okay, bypass the cache for one run. This temporary workaround can buy us time.
好，一次运行绕过缓存。这个临时措施可以争取时间。

2
00:00:06.576 --> 00:00:13.200
Raj: The isolated build uses approved settings. We keep verification enabled, right?
隔离构建用批准设置。验证继续启用，对吧？

3
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:19.872
Lukas: Yes, no signature or checksum exceptions. Cap concurrency to protect the mirror.
对，签名和校验和不能豁免。限制并发，保护镜像源。

4
00:00:19.872 --> 00:00:26.496
Anika: Could disabling all caches restore speed? Sorry, restore builds, not speed.
关掉所有缓存能恢复速度吗？抱歉，是恢复构建，不是速度。

5
00:00:26.496 --> 00:00:33.552
Hannah: Only the implicated cache is isolated. Wider changes would blur our evidence.
只隔离涉事缓存。更广泛的变更会混淆证据。

6
00:00:33.552 --> 00:00:40.920
Raj: Restricted inspection found no stored credentials. I'll rotate the diagnostic credential anyway.
受限检查未发现存储凭据。我仍会轮换诊断凭据。

7
00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:47.904
Lukas: Revoke it after the approved test. If exposure appears, involve security immediately.
批准测试后撤销它。若发现泄漏，立即找安全团队。

8
00:00:47.904 --> 00:00:56.040
Priya: Just to confirm, what's our rollback trigger? Invalid content means stop, not bypass verification.
确认一下，回退触发条件是什么？内容无效就停止，不能绕过验证。

9
00:00:56.040 --> 00:01:04.032
Hannah: And preserve any suspected cache poisoning evidence. Don't delete quarantined objects yet.
也保留疑似缓存污染证据。暂时别删隔离对象。

10
00:01:04.032 --> 00:01:10.680
Anika: Fair, roughly one build first then. No deployment permission comes with this test.
明白，那先大约一个构建。这个测试不附带部署许可。

